Package: vcdinteractive
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Displays for Visualizing Categorical Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Antonio", "Irpino", email = "antonio.irpino@unicampania.it",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive versions of the displays of the 'vcd' and
    'vcdExtra' packages, rendered as 'htmlwidgets'. Mosaic, association,
    sieve and doubledecker plots share one widget, in which variables can be
    reordered, added or removed and split directions changed on the fly,
    tiles report observed and expected counts on hover, several kinds of
    residuals (Pearson, adjusted standardized, deviance, Freeman-Tukey,
    Anscombe and residuals from a robust fit) can be used for shading, and
    log-linear models can be compared. Cells that depart significantly from
    the model are listed with multiplicity-adjusted p-values. Further
    widgets provide pairwise mosaic matrices with linked highlighting,
    fourfold displays with log odds ratio plots, rootograms for discrete
    distributions, spinograms and conditional density plots,
    correspondence analysis maps and association graphs.
License: GPL-2 | GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: htmlwidgets, stats, grDevices, utils
